      "category": "src_content",
      "full_page": "\"Reason, as the mistress of the little kingdom within each one of us, should call the will to frequent account, and the other faculties of the soul & senses of the body - as the stuart & other ser- vants are called, that the master may know how his business stands, i.e. his profits & losses - & to see that each one of his house hold receives enough and nothing superfluous or extravagant. S. Chrysostum",
